@StudentWebPortal_HostAddress = https://localhost:7197
@StudentId = 1
@AttendanceId = 1
@HifzId = 1
@RevisionId = 1


### Health check (is the API up and can it reach PostgreSQL?)
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/health


### List students (paging)
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json


### Search students (case-insensitive: name, email or phone) + active filter
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students?search=ahmed&isActive=true
Accept: application/json


### Create student (email is lower-cased, phone is stored as +E.164)
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Sample Student",
  "email": "sample.student@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "98765 43210",
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-11-19",
  "notes": "Created for API smoke testing"
}


### Get student by ID
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students/{{StudentId}}
Accept: application/json


### Student progress summary (attendance rate + Hifz/revision activity)
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students/{{StudentId}}/summary
Accept: application/json


### Patch student (RFC 6902 JSON Patch)
PATCH {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students/{{StudentId}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/Notes", "value": "Updated via PATCH" }
]


### Attendance: list records for a student
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/student/{{StudentId}}
Accept: application/json


### Attendance: get by record ID
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/{{AttendanceId}}
Accept: application/json


### Attendance: create (date defaults to today)
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "sessionStatus": 0,
  "notes": "Sample attendance record",
  "recordedBy": 0
}


### Attendance: back-dated record (future dates are rejected)
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "attendanceDate": "2026-11-18",
  "sessionStatus": 2,
  "notes": "Arrived late",
  "recordedBy": 1
}


### Attendance: patch status (0 = Present, 1 = Absent, 2 = Late)
PATCH {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Attendance/{{AttendanceId}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/SessionStatus", "value": 2 }
]


### Hifz: filter sessions
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/HifzSession?studentId={{StudentId}}&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json


### Hifz: create (Al-Fatiha has 7 verses)
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/HifzSession
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "sessionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "surah": 1,
  "verseStart": 1,
  "status": 0,
  "rank": 0,
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "notes": "Sample Hifz session",
  "recordedBy": 0
}


### Hifz: invalid verse -> 400 ("Verse 8 does not exist in AlFatiha; it has 7 verses.")
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/HifzSession
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "sessionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "surah": 1,
  "verseStart": 8,
  "status": 0,
  "rank": 0,
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "recordedBy": 0
}


### Revision: filter sessions
GET {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/RevisionSession?studentId={{StudentId}}&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json


### Revision: create
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/RevisionSession
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "sessionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "surah": 1,
  "verseStart": 1,
  "verseEnd": 5,
  "status": 0,
  "rank": 0,
  "durationMinutes": 15,
  "notes": "Sample revision session",
  "recordedBy": 0
}


### Revision: verseEnd past the end of the surah -> 400
POST {{StudentWebPortal_HostAddress}}/api/RevisionSession
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{StudentId}},
  "sessionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "surah": 1,
  "verseStart": 1,
  "verseEnd": 8,
  "status": 0,
  "rank": 0,
  "durationMinutes": 15,
  "recordedBy": 0
}
